-    c. Reset parameters of $i_{LC}$:
-    $$ \text{sh\_coeffs}_{i_{LC}} \leftarrow 0, \quad \text{aco\_offset}_{i_{LC}} \leftarrow 0 $$
-    d. Clear optimizer state of $i_{LC}$ [S1].
